{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9DaGluZXNlLU1vdmllcy9Ccm90aGVyJTIwTGl1JTIwQW5kJTIwQnJvdGhlciUyMFdhbmclMjBPbiUyMFRoZSUyMFJvYWRzJTIwSW4lMjBUYWl3YW4lMjBQYXJ0JTIwMSUyMCUyODE5NTklMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Brother Liu And Brother Wang On The Roads In Taiwan Part 1","description":"Overweight shoeshiner Brother Wang (Wang Ge) and skinny rickshaw driver Brother Liu (Liu  Ge) are best friends and roommates. One day, they come across a fortune teller who offers a  peculiar forecast: that Wang will become very wealthy in three days but that Liu will die in 44  days. When Wang strikes gold by winning the lottery, just as predicted, the celebratory mood is  soon eclipsed by the reminder that Liu’s death also has been forecast. With his newfound  wealth, Wang decides to reward his dying buddy with the trip of a lifetime. Carrying around a  suitcase full of cash, the working-class twosome embark on a road trip around the beautiful island  of Taiwan. Enjoying a lavish lifestyle as inexperienced big spenders, they find themselves in unexpected  situations and amusing predicaments, one after another.\n\nReleased 7 Feb 1959 · Taiwan · Language: Chinese · 88 min\nStudio: Tai Lien Film Company\n\nOn your server — Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"1959","genres":["Comedy","Others"],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rUbSgMl1rnUKgC1E2550JP3ct40.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hZ7NKbkE91B6YNVYLnYiuGjMkVe.jpg","imdbRating":"6.0","imdb_id":"tt1854374","moviedb_id":403043,"tmdbId":403043,"runtime":"88 min","cast":["Li Kuan-Chang","Ai Chai-Choi","Lin Lin"],"director":["Tien Feng","Lee Hsing"],"released":"1959-02-07T00:00:00.000Z","country":"Taiwan","language":"Chinese","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Tien Feng","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qoPyMy8NCZZ6aYMDtXIW6oLtx3r.jpg"},{"name":"Li Kuan-Chang","character":"Brother Wang","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dNhw3mGa